# The heartbeat URL from your Grafana OnCall integration, one line, no quotes.
# The region is part of the host and differs per stack -- oncall-prod-us-central-0,
# oncall-prod-eu-west-0, and others. Copy the WHOLE URL from the integration's
# Heartbeat panel rather than editing this one: a wrong region resolves and then
# 403s on the token, which looks identical to a working heartbeat until the day it
# was supposed to save you. scripts/verify_paging.sh sends one and reads the status.
https://oncall-prod-<region>.grafana.net/oncall/integrations/v1/alertmanager/<token>/heartbeat/
